WEBVTT

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:09.320
Smile!

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.510
I'm a little bit of a mess.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.830
I'm sorry, Shuta-kun.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:33.480
Thank you, Hawk.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.580
It's all thanks to the coaching you gave me.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:41.270
No, I was just advising him on his weaknesses.

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:45.320
Anyway, Shuta adores you like a real brother.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:49.560
If it's what you say, I'll listen to everything you say.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:52.560
Even more than what my father says.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:04.350
- It's the Diver. - Diver? Long time no see. How are you?

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:07.550
Hawk, listen. A ship was attacked at Kanada.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:16.170
It's their doing. A video was retrieved from the shipyard.

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:18.880
I sent it to the research institute. Check it out yourself.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:47.750
There's no doubt. It's Brad and Gilmer.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:50.790
Chief, something terrible has happened.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:54.220
So you were the only one who told me?

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.040
That's right. The Decepticons have started moving.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:05.620
Doc, did you see that? That's my Captain Shooter!

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.860
Shooter, go downstairs.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:10.820
You should talk to Shooter, too.

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:11.710
But...

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:19.190
No matter if he's a baby or a child, they'll kill him mercilessly.

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:23.590
If he shows up again, Shooter will be in danger.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.620
I understand. Maybe you're right.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:30.000
Hey, what are you talking about? I don't care!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:34.770
Shuta-kun, I'm not an Earthling.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:40.300
What? You're an alien?

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:41.930
Yeah.

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:49.740
You see, Mr. Hawk, if you think you can beat me, you're a little better than you seem.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.080
That's a serious question.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:51.830
What?

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:57.490
I came from the planet Cybertron, far, far away from Earth.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:07.240
To be precise, it's a super-robot life form called the Transformers.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:11.320
- Many of them? - That's right.

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:18.160
Humans, animals, and living things can transform into anything.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:22.980
Among the Transformers, there's a clan called the Pretenders.

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:39.010
In the Sabertron system, the battle between the Autobots and the Decepticons never ended.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:43.440
We chased after the enemy's pretender and entered the solar system.

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:48.460
In the middle of the battle, we hurt each other and fell to Earth.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:51.390
At that time, the Earth was a place where humans lived in holes,

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:55.280
and where they would hunt animals with stones and animal bones.

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:59.510
After we lost our ship, we transformed into humans,

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:04.420
They also changed themselves into demons.

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:10.020
After a long battle, we won and sealed the demons into the earth.

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:17.920
But they came back to life again.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.040
They're all crying out.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:40.250
Tentakel, destroy it!

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:42.460
It's Minagoroki's turn.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:45.370
Kaurotsu, are you trying to escape?

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.240
Brad!

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:49.240
What you're going to do is nothing.

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:51.060
What did you say?

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:52.060
Are you going to do it?

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:53.060
Stop it!

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:55.760
It's not the time to be friends!

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:22.280
I'll take care of it.

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:24.720
I'll lure out a team of Cybertron.

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:26.750
You're not scared, are you?

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:27.750
No, I'm coming.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.700
I'm that kind of guy.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:42.810
The monster has appeared and the city is in a state of panic.

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:43.870
This is bad...

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:44.950
Destron...

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:48.380
Use on!

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:17.190
It's a date, but it's a joke.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:19.040
What is it? What is this?

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:25.410
It's a f*cking date!

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:24.700
I knew it. The plan is a success.

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:30.000
I'll beat you to death, you bastard!

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:32.190
- I'll go first! - What?

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:33.140
Wait!

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:36.350
We have to use the Pentakill to see what's going on.

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:39.890
We are Takami's spectators.

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:42.870
Let go of me!

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:28.290
Metal Hawk, it's been a while.

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:40.580
I've been wanting to see you, Hawk.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:46.870
For thousands of years, you've locked us up in a shallow basement.

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:49.460
How did you get out of here?

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:54.980
I'll let you do as much as you want with all the spirits you've had up to now!

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:59.220
Taaah!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.670
That's it, Hawk.

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:24.760
I'm sorry, but you're going to die.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:26.740
What are you after?

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:28.090
Why the Earth?

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.000
I know what you're after.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:34.790
I will take control of the universe and build the Decepticons' empire.

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:39.210
That's all I can say.

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:41.210
Hawk, prepare yourself!

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:52.100
X, you're late!

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:55.020
I'm not. I haven't eaten breakfast yet.

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:57.930
Hey, stop fooling around!

00:16:59.260 --> 00:16:59.830
Fire!

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:11.840
- I can't stand being held hostage! - Interesting!

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:32.510
- How are you? - I'm fine!

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:44.690
- Blaster! - Aoroth, your opponent is me, Lander!

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:50.110
- You're dead! - What are you doing?

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:52.830
How cowardly!

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:06.140
If you want to save your kid's life, then stop resisting!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:14.590
- They're under attack! - Yeah!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:44.330
Are you okay?

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:49.190
I'm okay, Hawk!

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:34.610
The first human I saw seemed to be weak and unreliable.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:45.750
However, he was kind, thoughtful, and brave to risk his life for the sake of his loved ones.

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:51.440
We met humans and were shocked at how wonderful they were.

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:55.060
That's why we transformed into humans.

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:57.890
Oak?

00:19:57.890 --> 00:20:00.000
We just needed to be strong.

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:10.240
In order to protect the people who taught us that, we will rise.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:16.000
As long as we are here, we will protect this peaceful and beautiful Earth.

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:19.330
We will fight against the Decepticons that have reappeared!

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:04.310
Thousands of years have passed, and now again...

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:10.740
The fateful battle between the devil's messenger, Destron, and Cybertron has begun.

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:15.260
Stand up, warrior of justice, Cybertron!

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:18.880
Fight, Pretender!

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:38.240
On the island of Karin, the boys disappear one by one.

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:40.500
It's all Brad's doing.

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:46.080
The prince of the Kingdom of Karin, Cab, stands alone against Destron.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:47.870
Next time on Transformers!

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:49.940
Superhuman Master Force!

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:52.980
Fear! Destron's Human Hunting!

00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:56.480
Now, with Master Force, you too will transform!
